<!--
    German. Everyday words, as banking and budgeting apps use them, rather than literal ones.
    The reader is addressed as "du". German runs longest of all the languages: keep labels short.

    Glossary (keep these the same everywhere):
        transaction        Buchung              expense    Ausgabe        income    Einnahme
        savings / saved    Ersparnis / gespart  balance    Saldo          amount    Betrag
        savings (the % on Home)  Sparquote      category   Kategorie      note      Notiz
        settings           Einstellungen        export     Export, exportieren
        backup / restore   Sicherung / wiederherstellen
        delete             löschen              save       speichern      cancel    abbrechen
        undo               rückgängig           search     suchen         title     Titel
        bill (scanned)     Beleg                app lock   App-Sperre     screen lock  Displaysperre
        built-in / custom  Standard / eigene

    Kept as they are: CSV, Excel, Google Sheets, Cashback, Shopping and the app's name.

    Numbers use Western digits. Not here on purpose: strings marked translatable="false"
    in values/strings.xml, which read the same in every language.
-->
